# Plugin receipt telemetry — append-only, unsigned, written into whichever
# directory a tool happened to run in. Regenerable noise, not project history.
receipts/
review-receipts/

# The impeccable design hook's cache — per-session edit counts and "clean"
# acknowledgements, keyed by session id. Every concurrent session rewrites it,
# so a tracked copy turns each commit into a snapshot of whatever OTHER sessions
# happened to be editing at the time. Regenerable bookkeeping, not project history.
/.impeccable/
